Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you accidentally killed a plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And want to revive it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you set it on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,..and then freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it grow on the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,OR zap it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it a fancy dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or feed it to a fish monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Or push it off a cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Explode it!-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vomit on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Play with it underwater-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! You're only hurting it more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was huh... one of my\h\N"funny-plant-revival" ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So... just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,dunk it underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! Hopefully it'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After how badly we did at making a\h\Nsuitable environment for the plants,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't wanna take any chances with\h\Nhow livable YOUR environment was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I even got six new, shiny plates\h\Nfor us all to use at the benches!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, these plates are worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,$10,000 shiny ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this pool useless. I just\h\Nwant to look at these plates all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One down, five to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,NO! No more smashing Pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect these for me Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,BLEH!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for break at plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ðŸŽµ Hey Two! ðŸŽµ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,ðŸŽµ When you bake a cake ðŸŽµ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,ðŸŽµ Decorate and take it to\h\Nthe players who are safe ðŸŽµ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,ðŸŽµ That's how you know it's Cake\hat Stake ðŸŽµ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.22,0:01:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ðŸŽµ Cake At Stake ðŸŽµ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,First up is Just Not for pouring\h\Ncursed water onto their plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's cake is ramen noodles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're long, secure, unrippable,\h\Nand perfect for bungee jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it sure is crowded here with two teams...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow, you are safe with 3,211 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! I deserve it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Price Tag is the next safe with 3,172 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help with clearing out space up here, Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bomby, Nickel, and Cake are safe with\h\N2,989, 2,970, and 2,854 votes respectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHH!!! x3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And the last contestant safe on Just Not is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Book!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With 2,822 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,WAH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Naily is out with 2,286 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Onto Death Pact Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Marker is safe with 10,484 votes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your team can join in too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice death prevention, Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Also safe are Black Hole and Tree, with\h\N8,037 and 5,102 votes respectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just jump off, Pillow. I get the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning, Fanny, and Remote. The\h\Nthree of you are only separated by\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,a 16-vote difference, but only\h\Ntwo of you can be safe today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me? Am I safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you are, or else this would\h\Nbe awkward. You're safe with 5,043 votes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha! Can't toss us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Remote, Fanny. One of you got 5,038\h\Nvotes. The other got 5,027 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But which is it, huh? Which of- which\h\None- oh, who's it gonna be? Wow!-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us who is SAFE! HURRY UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to reward bad behavior, but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fanny is safe with 5,038 votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry Naily and Remote,\h\Nbut you've been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well Remote, I think you NAILED it either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think you- remoted it.\NUm-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah that pun doesn't really work for my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I think you both twoed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...Doesn't work as well for my name, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry Two, I'll clear all these noodles up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The beautiful plates! Where are they going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Not the steepest hill in the grasslands!
