Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With these plates missing, our living\h\Nquarters are approximately 40% less livable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be just like those Funny Plants in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's challenge is to retrieve the five\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful plates from the\h\Nbottom of the Goiky Canal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The two teams that do not retrieve\h\Na plate will be up for elimination!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I HATE WATER! What is our strategy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing fancy, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We just dive in, hold our\h\Nbreaths, and look for the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bit of a problem with that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how will you guys communicate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a Yoyle Dance class that\h\Ntaught me to speak through dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, read this book, and study up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I HATE READING, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Done. Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay...\NDone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No. The problem with the plan is that\h\Nyou can't hold your breath forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we didn't breathe, we'd die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we'll prevent death by holding\h\Nour breath. Team Breath P.A.C.T.!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Strongest Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Flower and I have been tinkering with an\h\Ninvention that should come in handy for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're breathable bubbles, which will\h\Nallow us to run and bounce about underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect for electrical ol' me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,HA HA HA HA!!\NThat is nothing compared to our invention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The robotic fish monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are You Okay, we'll simply use this machine\h\Nto drive into the water and find the-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Shouldn't have gotten\h\Ncocky out there, Golf Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our team's now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That is unfair-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, wait. Where's TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,(SCREAM!)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we kidnapped someone by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, pretty please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry TV, you're officially in the hostage zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The canal! You all know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, welcome to the Stuff\h\Nfor Yourself online store!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's order a fishing rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice. Now let's grab that\h\Nplate! Uh, doesn't work, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it doesn't, you nincompoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That plate is miles underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Pin. What we actually need is-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A vacuum, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can suck up the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Coiny, why did you make us order that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr! Okay! What we actually need is the world's\h\Nstrongest magnet to suck up the plate to the surf-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope! We need to order a second moon! Moon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need floaties to help us swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep your pesky\h\Nhands away from the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you ordered the Moon 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I did not order the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered the magnet, and uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,GAH!\NCurse your fiddly hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We ordered it to Yellow Face's\h\Nfactory, which is 2,762 miles away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,2,76.. 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Not everything is always the same distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need to catch the nearest\h\Ntrain! We don't have much time, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow! Today, you might've saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I always go out of my way to help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what were you saying, Cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, remember when all of us falling from the top\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,of the hotel caused a big splash in the\h\Npool, and everything flew everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Are you saying we should drop from a\h\Ndramatic height and burst into the canal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You silly gooses! How can we get that\h\Nastronomically shastatomically high?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a scientist on our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we possibly build a contraption like\h\Nthat? All we have is this debris from the canal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. Book! Define 'gravity'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That definition sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Let's start tossing\h\Nthese, and fly into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Pillow, enough messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha- Everyone! Follow that pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? The slowest train ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wish this was the fastest train ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Donut: Aah! Barf Bag! Undo this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's bad luck to undo your wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fishy is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to dwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, we must use Basketball's\h\Npitiful breathable bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only six bubbles for their team, so\h\NPuffball, you can sit this one out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Now that's the third time you've\h\Ntreated Puffball badly! Back off, Golf Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Fries, you must understand that she is\h\Nnot to be trusted! She'll sabotage our team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about Puffball and I\h\Ngo sabotage the other teams?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Puffball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eraser, you comin', bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'd rather mess with\h\NTeardrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan, TD?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:10:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time you hung on a windowsill.\h\NWhat's next, playing with a hose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha?! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If this was like, a giant eraser or whatever,\h\NI'd become part of that, too- if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Eraser! Just get in the water already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After Teardrop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After the robot fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the plates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone have any ideas? Winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fill Bottle with the lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea, Icy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the canal is dried up and dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's barely done anything.\h\NLet's just get into the canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a shovel! Why don't\h\Nyou just dig under the canal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,HAHAHAHAHA! I doubt they'd fall for\h\Nthat- wait, they're doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This idea's grand! That was SO nice\h\Nof Fries to give us this shovel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ogh! I guess they DIED!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,TRY AGAIN, TEAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally... Now our strategy seems to be paying o-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,ATTEMPT THREE!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally! The canal! Now we-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should try something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Agh! I thought that'd work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Icy! I'm so sorry! I- woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The water here is freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's freeze the canal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we could trap the other\h\Nteams underneath the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that stealing BASKETBALL thinking she can steal my inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,, while we're\hleft in these useless breathing bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, try to embrace what we\h\Nalready have, Golf Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I will not embrace it! It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah! Be careful where you bounce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Pen! You've crossed a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hit Golf Ball like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eraser! Put a stop to this madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge! Where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Here's a package for you, Coiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.56,0:12:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...A world-ending bomb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! G'uh- wrong package, hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did you order-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it! The world's strongest magnet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Status report, Snowball!\h\NHow's the team been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when I drove the fish, I smashed us\h\Nheadfirst into a wall, and then straight\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,into the floor. Then I don't even know how this\h\Nhappened: I got the fish back on land and drove\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,us around a bit. I ended up taking us through a\h\Ndrive-thru, and now I'm here eating some fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not great. They prepared them for a fish.\h\NAnd then we let Grassy control the robot,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and then he communicated with the nearby fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,*clears throat*
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Grassy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we let Bell drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Bell, you can do anything!-- Uh,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,she wasn't trying to be dramatic.\h\NShe genuinely just couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your leadership abilities\h\Non this side have been disatrous,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Basketball. I've been keeping the hostage\h\Nin line, and TV's been fully cooperating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Robot Flower's been\h\Nlooking after him, if anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Flower! They don't care\h\Nabout us machines. We should\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,take down this fish before it gets out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, TV. I'm sticking with my team!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:14:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Flower, trust me. Destroy it before it gets\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,out of control. Us mechanical\h\Nminds have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just Not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just not what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, flying into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's preposterous. I- oh, what the?! After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, excuse me, how the heck is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the power of misdefinition,\h\Nanything is possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Puffball, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah! Help me, help me, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow? You mind taking care of Puffball for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries! Bye, Bomby!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye and good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah! Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Puffball! Start chomping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we like, go join that mayhem, or nah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I kind of like getting to have a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the juice is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, can I try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! The top is rock solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean ice\hsolid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Icy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we just wait for someone to swim on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, TD!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You want me to follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are- oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The plates! You found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, TD?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,*Scary noises...*
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Teardrop, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pen! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I haven't been in control\h\Nfor at least 80 bounces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:16:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why we need to only have SOME\h\Nteam members perform certain tasks, Tennis Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pen goofed off, and now\h\Nwe're all paying the price!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You bumped me first,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and who made you the team leader anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be just as good as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd slap you, but the bouncing bubbles\h\Nare already doing a good job at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Help! A monster is\h\Ncoming! Escape while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Eraser, we're stuck here! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Pen, I've got two of the\h\Nplates! Let's get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Look up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A DRAGON!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy to take care of. What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Us! Your biggest foes yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With me and Puffball in the\h\Nway, there's nothing we can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Welp, didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At least the worst is over-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's just you and me, Pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,'m not worried! La la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me down, Coiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, this magnet lets\h\Nyou select what is attracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Everyone, get onto the train, now!\h\NCoiny, set the magnet to magnify the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But it won't move, and we'll be stuck here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Coiny, set it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! See you soon, Coiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea, Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call it a good idea! Call it a GREAT idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys! The fish thinks\h\Nwe're another fish monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Grassy communicated to the fish\h\Nearlier using this speaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's convince him to tell\h\Nus where the plates are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're tricking him! Hehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not cool. We\h\Nshouldn't be tricking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:18:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just using the robot to our\h\Nadvantage. What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to use robotics\h\Nto aid us, but to deceive others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No! We're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's just a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M just a machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just Grassy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that this must be\h\Nfrustrating for you, Robot Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should just go hang with\h\NTV until we're done with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we could do this! Us robots\h\Nare taking you all down with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Flower?! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Us mechanical minds gotta stick together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot Flower? TV? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! We have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoink! I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Two! This one goes to us. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure does!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The S! are safe! Congratulations to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant! Death P.A.C.T. Again are also safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the goal, Pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How is your sky staircase gonna\h\NPOSSIBLY help you win this challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it might be fun to\h\Nsometimes mess with gravity,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but sometimes, it's fun to let\h\Nnature do its thing as intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's a plate for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Just Not is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike those other teams, who are just not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Teardrop(s)!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! The teardrops are fading fast,\h\Nbecause you're safe once again, TD!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one more immunity is\h\Nup for grabs! Who will win,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are You Okay, The Strongest\h\NTeam on Earth, or Team8s?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one more shiny plate to save,\h\Nand it's almost too stressful to watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Snowball! See if you can open that hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sealed shut! I think the machines\h\Nlocked the doors! We're stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I think this is finally gonna-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,EXPLO-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I thought it was going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I guess it didn't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the plate is right here,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't win immunity! I need someone to\h\Ngive it to me for their immunity to count!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eraser! Go hand over that plate already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! Now just to hand it to you, and-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,World's. Strongest. Magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Two! The plate is all safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Coiny! All the plates have\h\Nbeen retrieved, which means- viewers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strongest Team on Earth. and Are\h\NYou Okay are both up for elimination,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but you only get one vote total,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so vote for one of them to stay in\h\Nthe game. Make your one vote count!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, it's me, Cary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, so that was TPOT 5.\h\NThank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, it looks like Are You Okay and\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strongest Team on Earth\h\Nare both up for elimination,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.62,0:21:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so whichever member on both teams gets the fewest\h\Nvotes from you, the viewers, will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.40,0:21:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the sad truth of how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, as we talked about in our\h\Nlast video, yes, we're gonna be\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,having a BFDI and Inanimate Insanity meetup\h\Nin both Los Angeles and New York this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you've been watching our shows for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be really cool to\h\Nsee you at one of our meetups.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the New York one just sold\h\Nout, so there are no more tickets left to get,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Los Angeles one still has a\h\Ngood chunk of tickets left to grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But also, let's not forget about this munchkin,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,this Two plush! Because I know a\h\Nlot of you have questions about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Two plushes will first be available\h\Nto buy at the actual meetup on location,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you come to the meetup, you'll be\h\Nthe first ones to get your hands on these.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you can't come to a\h\Nmeetup for whatever reason,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because you live far away or something like\h\Nthat, they will be available to purchase\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,online after the meetups as well, so\h\Neveryone can get their hands on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, that was TPOT 5. Thank you to\h\NSamuel Thornbury for managing this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I meant to say this last time,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but for the amazing TPOT Cake at Stake intro\h\Nthat starts with "Hey Two, when you bake a\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,cake," that whole song, that was written by\h\NAnko6theAnimator and animated by Highvan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just think that, like, it was really\h\Ncool seeing them work together on such a,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, really cool song\h\Nand really fluid animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a really great project. But yeah,\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,TPOT 5 has come to a close,\h\Nand I'll see you all in TPOT 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,*Cries*
